        "text": "I loved my experience with Diane when buying my first home! When I think of Diane, the first words that come to mind are: dynamic, professional, cheerful, and so much more! It's clear she's passionate about her work and she's always available for her clients! I highly recommend her! Thank you, Diane! 🤗",
