      {
        "author_name": "Isabelle Campeau",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111365841292299864069/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV-8eW1Lmg87DBNYKw40KZ_k5x4o6Z8NYz_v5HmvHMhwxsIrx6p=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Diane is the embodiment of efficiency and dynamism! She is there to support us throughout the search and the transaction, an asset up our sleeve! I highly recommend her.",
        "time": 1603811948,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cindy Brian",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115797315878879458124/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIj5NV0oHEL_5iRpsJ2JGoxKusabbrXd6LTWeYtnPO_upppkA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Total lack of professionalism. Ms. Laplante intrusively questions me about my finances as a prerequisite for the VISIT of a house that has just been put up for sale. Yes, madam, I know how to read numbers. If I request a visit, it is because I have the necessary funds for the purchase. I consider it a total lack of respect for the buyer as well as a handicap for the seller when his agent rejects buyers before even doing the visit. The house interested me, but not to put money in Ms. Laplante's pockets.",
        "time": 1646688212,
        "translated": true
      }
